<title>POLAND: JELFA SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>JELFA SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.40 vs   0.55</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.07 vs   1.03</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.06 vs   1.04</p>
<p> Sales		   11.71 vs  10.60</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    15.65 vs  12.23</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	22.69 vs  18.44</p>
<p> Operating profit    21.32 vs  18.67</p>
<p> Sales		  109.62 vs  95.05</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish drug maker is Jelfa SA.</p>
<p>The company said it had used a 1.66 million-zloty relief for</p>
<p>investment spending. It had also created a 666,000 zloty</p>
<p>provision for a deferred income tax payment. </p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
